commit 7ccf9cb35756e338baf56113e940b7a06c02d758

C03: referent clarifier must not invent a verb; noise clarification must name what arrived (DIALOGUE1279 residual)

clarify_missing_referent: the voseo guidance no longer carries an «abrir» example; an assent without action («si hazlo», «dale, hacelo») that yields a concrete verb gets one corrected retry, then fails closed. clarify_unresolved_input: for symbol/digit/letter input the question must name what arrived or say no request is visible, with one corrected retry.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


